   "description": "ChemInfo is a repository of chemical information. In addition to physicochemical, ecotoxicological, toxicological parameters, ChemInfo also stores information on their occurrences in the environment. This information is primarily relevant for the fields of environmental, consumer, disaster and occupational safety. ChemInfo includes information on dangers posed by these substances, on protective and operational measures as well as the reproduction of the material-related content from legal regulations. Much of the site is available in English, with selected curation drawn from automatically translated content.",
