   "url": "https://chem.echa.europa.eu/",
   "description": "It includes all public data submitted to ECHA in REACH registration dossiers by substance manufacturers, importers, or their representatives, as laid out by the REACH Regulation (see Understanding REACH regulation). ECHA CHEM is ECHA’s new public chemicals database, launched in early 2024. Initially, it only includes information from the REACH portion of the old knowledgebase. Over the coming years, ECHA will gradually transfer the rest of the data it makes publicly available from their current locations. During the transition, users may need to consult both ECHA CHEM and the former platform. The URL to the old database is available under the 'Data Processes and Conditions' section of this record.",
